 # Changes in this update
 
+## 28 October 2026: Appendix 2 — Cremona research programme
+
+- Add a separate Russian research preprint with the existing preprint layout,
+  dated 28 October 2026, with portable XeLaTeX/Overleaf sources and bibliography.
+- State the exact birational stabilizer-coset formulation and distinguish
+  polynomial rectification from generic birational straightening.
+- Provide working proofs of wildness for the selected Shastri, harmonic and
+  `C_N` rectifiers, standard Cremona subgroup membership and stable tameness.
+- Distinguish specific excluded conjectural candidates, known literature inputs,
+  inherited Appendix 1 consequences and open questions; retain the status
+  **UNDER VERIFICATION** and an invitation to collaborative research.
+- Add an offline exact certificate with English comments, normal/optimized
+  runs and negative controls; finite tests cover `N = 1, 2, 3`.
+- Rerun the original compact and printed-formula certificates successfully.
+  The original paper, its formulas, the original verifiers and Appendix 1 are
+  unchanged. Refresh checksums for the proposed update.
+
 ## 26 October 2026: combined audit corrections
 
 - Display the exact-division formula in README as a standalone mathematical block outside list nesting.
