index b065ab8..df7a8ad 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -14,6 +14,24 @@ certificate is included.
 
 The paper is organized as **methods → trefoil → harmonic figure-eight**.
 
+## Research appendices — under verification
+
+- [Appendix 1: harmonic embeddings, Cremona constructions and LNDs (26 October 2026)](appendices/2026-10-26-harmonic-lnd/README.md).
+- [Appendix 2: Cremona groups and polynomial rectification (28 October 2026)](appendices/2026-10-28-cremona-program/README.md) · [PDF](appendices/2026-10-28-cremona-program/appendix2_cremona_program_ru.pdf) · [Overleaf-compatible source](appendices/2026-10-28-cremona-program/latex/main.tex).
+
+Appendix 2 develops a research direction connecting the explicit rectifiers to
+relative automorphisms, Cremona subgroups and the removal of poles. It records
+working proofs of wildness for the selected rectifiers, their membership in
+the standard Cremona subgroup and their stable tameness, together with exact
+English-commented computational certificates. It separates these consequences
+from the general problems that remain open.
+
+**All appendix statements remain under verification.** The author shares these
+materials in the hope that they grow into a research programme contributing to
+Cremona theory, birational geometry and affine geometry, and invites others to
+check, correct and extend them. Internal AI-assisted checks are not external
+independent peer review; publication priority is not asserted.
+
 ## Acknowledgements
 
 The author expresses his sincere gratitude to Alexei Kanel-Belov and Alexander Frolov.
